WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.650
When we feel happy, the brain releases more dopamine.

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:14.150
When dopamine is released excessively, it leads to psychosis and delusions,

00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:16.450
similar to schizophrenia.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:22.450
It's unpredictable: some people use a lot and nothing happens,

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:26.650
but others use just a little — and psychosis appears.

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:32.450
So we must be absolutely firm: no further use,

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:38.950
otherwise accidents can happen, even to their own loved ones.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:46.450
Brain damage caused by meth is very hard to recover from, and there is still no effective treatment.
